        BM25sub / BM25body are QUERY-TIME lexical rankers (whole-name / subtoken /
        subtoken+body); fused = RRF(ripwire, BM25sub); anchored = BM25body + anchored PPR
... [5 more line(s); run it to see the whole thing]
